        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "The core problem this system solves is that traditional sales outreach is often too generic, making it hard for prospects to see the value in an offer. Teams waste countless hours on manual research and struggle with inconsistent follow-ups. The workflow starts by defining the ideal customer, finding new prospects, and enriching the data. It then uses AI to generate personalized demonstrations, conducts intelligent outreach, and manages nurturing based on how the customer engages. Nour worked across the commercial logic and the follow-up layer. He defined the target segments and criteria for prioritization, and built parts of the demo follow-up engine, including inbox sync and booking detection.",
